INTRODUCTION

Welcome to SCARLET PRISM! A frenetic, fast-paced, colourful 2D twin-stick shooter.

You are Astraea, an angelic maiden, thrown onto an arena, destined to fight off corrupt, scarlet prisms (!) and corrupted celestial beings for all eternity. Or, for as a long as you can survive.

You can play the game on itch.io - it's available for Windows, Linux, or directly in your browser! All free of charge, forever.

Features:
* Endless arcade carnage - how long will you survive? That is the question.
* Overstimulating visuals, just as we love it!
* 3 devastating weapons for you to play around, as well as an upgrade system for you main gun.
* 8 dangerous celestial enemies!
* Pounding electronic music by Cadmium! 
* Online scoreboard!
* High refresh rate support!

Game made by Matvey Kerov (aeterasu/thejohnyfeed). Music by Cadmium. Made with Godot 4.6 in 2026.

