CONTROLS

Keyboard and mouse:

Game:
* WASD - movement
* Mouse - aim
* Left Mouse Button - rapid shot
* Right Mouse Button (or Space) - special weapon

Alternatively, you can aim and shoot using the arrow keys on your keyboard.

Misc:
* Escape (or P, for web version) - pause
* R - restart

GAMEPAD:

Game:
* Left Analogue Stick - move
* Right Analogue Stick - aim and shoot
* Any of the bumper buttons (RB/LB/RT/LT) - special weapon

Misc:
* Start - pause
* Select - restart

