OVERVIEW

In Scarlet Prism, you are thrown onto a circular arena, and are tasked with fending off against endlessly spawning enemies. The game has no end other than your death, and your goal is to kill as many enemies as possible, while scoring as much as possible. You will die in one hit, so careful dodging and quick offenses are you best friend!

Your main gun shoot continuously as long as you hold the button and has endless ammunition. All of your attacks can destroy enemies' bullets - use that to your advantage.

Enemies spawn in small waves - once you finish off a wave, the next one spawns. If you're too slow, however, the next wave will spawn regardless, giving you no breathing room! Exciting. After certain waves, pickups will spawn - the first one will be a special weapon pickup, which grants you an additional attack of your choice, and all others will be linear upgrades for your main gun. There is no RNG involved in those - that ain't the kind of game we're playing here.

