WEAPONS

Special weapons are devastating, yet limited.

Once you pick up a special weapon, press the special weapon button to fire it. Firing it will consume a certain amount of ammo (exact amount depends on your gun) - you cannot fire gun at all if you do not have enough ammo. Enemies killed with the special weapon will drop little colourful stars - those are score items! Be sure to pick them up to get lots of score. Enemies will also sometimes drop small ammo packs - quickly pick them up to replenish your ammo. They will disappear if not picked up. A single ammo pickup restored 40% of your ammo.

Guns:

BUCKSHOT SALVO:

    - Fast firing shotgun. Shoots a wide arc of slow projectiles, dealing high damage and destroying all of the enemy projectiles in their path. Costs 15% ammo per shot. Useful for clearing a wide area.

HYPER LASER:

    - Devastating railgun that fires a straight laser with pinpoint accurasy, penetrating through multiple enemies and dealing extreme damage and destroing enemy projectiles. Your best bet for consistent scoring and clearing corridors of enemies. Costs 20% ammo per shot.

CASCADE MISSILE:

    - A slow firing missile launcher - shoots a slow moving projectile, that, when hits anything in its path, creates a devastating aoe explosion, and shoots multiple projectiles in all directions. Good for fullscreen damage. Costs 30% ammo per shot.

